msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Nexus source docs\nReport-Msgid-Bugs-To: \nLanguage: zh_CN\nLanguage-Team: Nexus agent-reviewed documentation\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nPlural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\nX-Nexus-Source-SHA256: ad76a5e99d2c9d01641053fd3bc7efc570757a9c8aba6ef9e5df07b006cc20f8\nX-Nexus-Reviewed: true\n"

msgid "Assembly input and rejected selections"
msgstr "装配输入与拒绝规则"

msgid "The authored configuration authority is one schema-2 TOML assembly. SoC and Board facts remain maintained JSON; `resolved.json` is output, not an authored alternative. CMake owns software dependencies. Failed TOML resolution never falls back to Kconfig, cache variables, schema-1 JSON or old generated headers."
msgstr "配置权威是一份 authored schema-2 TOML 装配。SoC 和 Board 事实保持维护中的 JSON；`resolved.json` 是输出，不是另一份 authored 输入。CMake 拥有软件依赖。TOML 解析失败绝不回退 Kconfig、cache 变量、schema-1 JSON 或旧生成头。"

msgid "Complete maintained input"
msgstr "完整维护输入"

msgid "Complete Native UART assembly, parsed by the production resolver."
msgstr "完整 Native UART 装配，由生产 resolver 解析。"

msgid "Selection"
msgstr "选择"

msgid "Meaning and rejection boundary"
msgstr "含义与拒绝边界"

msgid "`schema = 2`"
msgstr "`schema = 2`"

msgid "Authored TOML generation; unknown keys reject"
msgstr "Authored TOML 生成；未知键拒绝"

msgid "`board`"
msgstr "`board`"

msgid "Maintained immediate child of `boards/`; exactly one Board selector"
msgstr "`boards/` 的维护中直接子目录；必须恰好选择一个 Board"

msgid "`board_package`"
msgstr "`board_package`"

msgid "External package path relative to the assembly; alternative to `board`"
msgstr "相对装配定位的外部 package 路径；与 `board` 二选一"

msgid "`backend`"
msgstr "`backend`"

msgid "Explicit `native`, `baremetal`, `freertos` or supported `threadx` subset"
msgstr "显式 `native`、`baremetal`、`freertos` 或受支持 `threadx` 子集"

msgid "`clock`"
msgstr "`clock`"

msgid "Maintained exact profile matching Board and SoC facts"
msgstr "匹配 Board 与 SoC 事实的维护中精确 profile"

msgid "`optimization`"
msgstr "`optimization`"

msgid "Maintained optimization/debug/LTO profile; no arbitrary compiler override"
msgstr "维护中的优化/debug/LTO profile；不接受任意编译器覆盖"

msgid "`[memory]`"
msgstr "`[memory]`"

msgid "Byte budgets for stack, libc heap, static RAM and Flash LOAD"
msgstr "以 byte 记录栈、libc heap、静态 RAM 和 Flash LOAD 预算"

msgid "`[factory]`"
msgstr "`[factory]`"

msgid "Explicit optional strong IDs and capability metadata"
msgstr "显式可选 strong ID 和能力元数据"

msgid "Kind instance table"
msgstr "类别实例表"

msgid "Stable authored name, reviewed binding, mode and bounded options"
msgstr "稳定 authored 名称、复核 binding、模式与有界选项"

msgid "SPI/I2C device table"
msgstr "SPI/I2C 器件表"

msgid "Separate endpoint identity tied to an existing controller"
msgstr "关联已有 controller 的独立 endpoint 身份"

msgid "`[abi]`"
msgstr "`[abi]`"

msgid "Assert reviewed CPU architecture/FPU/float ABI; cannot invent chip features"
msgstr "断言复核 CPU architecture/FPU/float ABI；不能虚构芯片特性"

msgid "Resource checks cover actual pin/AF, controller, IRQ ceiling, shared timer/timebase, physical DMA controller/stream, clock, exact memory domain, mode and endpoint identity. A syntactically valid selector can still reject because that provider does not implement the route. The resolver never silently changes pins, modes or clock."
msgstr "资源检查包括实际 pin/AF、controller、IRQ ceiling、共享 timer/timebase、物理 DMA controller/stream、clock、精确内存域、模式和 endpoint 身份。语法合法的 selector 仍可能因 provider 未实现该路线而拒绝。Resolver 绝不悄悄更换 pin、模式或 clock。"

msgid "Inspect and generate"
msgstr "检查并生成"

msgid "Run from the repository root, using a new output you own:"
msgstr "从仓库根目录执行，使用自己拥有的新输出："

msgid "`check` and `explain` do not generate output. `generate` publishes one atomic owned bundle; failure invalidates its owned output without replacing unrelated data. Inspect `resolved.json`, input identities, generated `nexus_config.h`, bindings, factory, linker memory and budgets. Changing declared inputs requires a fresh resolution; separate Board/backend combinations use separate build roots."
msgstr "`check` 与 `explain` 不生成输出。`generate` 发布一个原子 owned bundle；失败使其 owned 输出失效，不替换无关数据。检查 `resolved.json`、输入身份、生成的 `nexus_config.h`、bindings、factory、linker memory 和预算。声明输入变化要求重新解析；不同 Board/backend 组合使用独立 build root。"

msgid "CPU-only Runtime has a separate authored runtime TOML using the shared CPU resolver. It emits Core/Arch/optional OS policy, no SoC/Board/startup/factory. Do not use it to claim a full device platform. The [build contract](../../design/build-system.md), [integration contract](../../design/integration-contracts.md) and production field model/schema own detailed accepted fields; editor completion does not establish hardware capability."
msgstr "CPU-only Runtime 使用独立 authored runtime TOML 和共享 CPU resolver。它只生成 Core/Arch/可选 OS 策略，不生成 SoC/Board/startup/factory。不得据此声明完整设备平台。[构建合同](../../design/build-system.md)、[接入合同](../../design/integration-contracts.md)和生产 field model/schema 拥有详细合法字段；编辑器补全不建立硬件能力。"

